    "AI 纪要": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI Notes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 只保存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串里，不写入任何文件，也不随 iCloud 同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your API key stays in this Mac's Keychain. It isn't written to any file or synced to iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 无效，请在设置里检查。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API key is invalid. Check it in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FireRedASR2 中英": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FireRedASR2 Zh/En"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moting": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moting 一直在菜单栏，关掉主窗口也能录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moting stays in the menu bar, so you can record with the main window closed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moting 同时录你的麦克风和对方的声音，在这台 Mac 上转写，不需要联网。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moting records your microphone and the other participants, then transcribes on this Mac. No internet needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moting 的所有文件都在一个文件夹里，可以在这里查看和删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All of Moting's files live in one folder. You can review and delete them here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paraformer 中文大模型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paraformer Zh (large)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-ASR 0.6B（支持热词）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qwen3-ASR 0.6B (hotwords)"
