    "上一步": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下次开始录音时生效。选定的设备断开时，录音自动改用系统默认，不会中断。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies the next time you record. If the chosen device disconnects, recording switches to the system default without stopping."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloads"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载失败：%@。如果你用代理上网，请在「下载」页填写代理地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download failed: %@. If you use a proxy, enter its address on the Downloads page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载完成后，本场录音会自动开始显示字幕": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captions for this recording start automatically once the download finishes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载语音模型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download speech models"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don't Record"
          }
        }
      }
    },
