      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zh/En Zipformer (2023)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为保护隐私，只能使用 https 地址（本机服务除外）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To protect your privacy, only https addresses are allowed (except local services)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主窗口、设置和菜单栏面板的明暗；悬浮字幕窗始终是深色，方便叠在会议画面上看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to the main window, Settings and the menu bar panel. The floating captions window is always dark so it stays readable over a meeting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "也可以先跳过：用到时会自动下载，已经录下的声音不会丢。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can skip this for now. Models download when needed, and nothing you record is lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "人声检测（Silero VAD）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice detection (Silero VAD)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "什么时候生成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When to generate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天的会议主要讨论三件事：第一是新版本的上线时间，第二是测试环境的搭建，第三是接口文档的评审。请大家会后把各自的待办整理一下，周五之前同步给我。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's meeting covers three things: first, the launch date of the new version; second, setting up the test environment; and third, reviewing the API documentation. After the meeting, please organize your action items and send them to me by Friday."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仍然重新转写": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcribe Again Anyway"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "代理地址": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy address"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "企业微信": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeCom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会上没有明确的待办。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No clear action items from this meeting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中实时字幕": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live captions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会再次把转写文字发送给 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transcript will be sent to %@ again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会后精准转写": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Post-meeting transcription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会后转写在用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In use for transcription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会把这场会议的转写文字（不含录音）发送给 %@，生成概要、决策和待办。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends this meeting's transcript (not the audio) to %@ to generate an overview, decisions and action items."
          }
        }
      }
    },
