    "麦克风一路与你的声纹匹配度偏低，这次没有过滤旁人声音。可以在设置里重新登记声纹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone track didn't closely match your voiceprint, so nearby voices weren't removed this time. You can enroll again in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麦克风或系统音频还没有允许，录音时可能录不到声音。之后可以在系统设置里打开。": {
      "localizations": {
